Modifications made in Yomikae include, among others:
- Rebranding (application name, package id, icons, links)
- A new phone navigation (Discover / Find / Follow / Bookshelf), a tag
  browser, following of uploaders, artists, circles and tags with new-gallery
  counts, and a "taste" analysis of the user's favourites
- Manga image translation: on-device text detection and recognition on
  Android (ONNX Runtime) and a local translation service on Windows
- Assorted fixes

Files carried over from JHenTai keep their original copyright and license.
"JHenTai" is the name of the original project; Yomikae is not affiliated with
or endorsed by it.

Third-party components used at runtime (downloaded on demand, not bundled):
- PP-OCRv6 small detection model, PaddlePaddle, Apache License 2.0
- PP-OCRv6 small recognition model fine-tuned for manga, fumetodev, Apache License 2.0
- EhTagTranslation database, see https://github.com/EhTagTranslation/Database
- e-hentai-tag-count data, see https://github.com/mokurin000/e-hentai-tag-count
